{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/01/4219446/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田は雪がこんもり積もってまーす!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マンホールの上はあんまり雪積もらないのよ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに写ってるのはいこまちゃんですヽ(・∀・)ノ\nみなさん２０１３年もよろしくお願いいたします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力で頑張る!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違う何かになれるように!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/01/4219446/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へび年という事で〜\nてーんちゃんとへびの秋田朗くんというキャラを産み出しました。\nよろしくね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/01/4219446/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/01/01/4219446/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真はカウントダウンの時の生駒です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶれすぎにもほとがあるぜ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}